PFX PA 0 anti/NONAMANEA1A2 .

# co-/con-
PFX PC Y 2
PFX PC 0 co/NONAMANEA1A2 .
PFX PC 0 con/V1V2V3VIVAVBVC .

# pre-
PFX PE Y 1
PFX PE 0 pre/NONAMANEA1A2V1V2V3VIVAVBVC .

# super-
