PFX PF 0 super/NONAMANEA1A2 .

# sotto-
PFX PG Y 1
PFX PG 0 sotto/V1V2V3VIVAVBVC .

# contr-/contro-
PFX PH Y 2
PFX PH 0 contr [aeiou]
PFX PH 0 contro [^aeiou]

# extra-/ultra-/iper-/ipo-/inter-
